            <h3>Information You Provide to Us</h3>
            <p>Information you may provide includes your name, email, Google or Apple username, birth date, place of birth, current residence, time of birth, and information about people in your personal circle (names, relationship types, birth dates). If you purchase our Services or products, you may provide your credit or debit card information. The Channel uses third parties to process payments — we do not collect or store credit card information.</p>

            <h3>Conversation Data</h3>
            <p>When you interact with Julie, our AI assistant, we store your conversation history to provide personalized insights and improve the quality of advice over time. This data is used exclusively to enhance your experience and is never shared with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

            <h3>Information Collected Automatically</h3>
            <p>When you access our Services, we may automatically collect information that is linked to your computer, phone, or other device, including:</p>
